UID:occ-1038@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:A new play by Bobbi Twiggs in development\, the first presenta
 tion of Play Haven's series.\n\nAn early look at a new play by Bobbi Twigg
 s\, still taking shape and shown here as the first presentation of Play Ha
 ven's development series. Staged in the rehearsal hall rather than on the 
 mainstage\, with the audience among the work's first witnesses. Hosted by 
 Theatrical Outfit.
