DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260823T163000
DTSTAMP:20260730T153943Z
UID:occ-1374@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Kesselring's black comedy: two sweet aunts\, a body in the win
 dow seat\, and elderberry wine best declined.\n\nJoseph Kesselring's 1941 
 farce\, later the Frank Capra film with Cary Grant. Drama critic Mortimer 
 Brewster is about to announce his engagement when he finds a corpse in his
  elderly aunts' window seat\, and the ladies are entirely unbothered by it
 . Their elderberry wine\, it turns out\, carries more than a hint of arsen
 ic. Also in the house: a brother convinced he is Teddy Roosevelt and a fug
 itive sibling with a face rebuilt by a shady plastic surgeon. From the Hen
 ry Players\, a volunteer community theatre company.
GEO:33.4486439;-84.1418279
LAST-MODIFIED:20260730T050010Z
LOCATION:The Henry Players Theater\, 136 Hood St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/arsenic-and-old-lace-tickets-271699
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Twelfth Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260823T150000
DTSTAMP:20260730T153943Z
UID:occ-1193@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Shakespeare's shipwreck comedy: twins separated at sea\, a wom
 an in disguise\, and a love triangle nobody can untangle.\n\nShakespeare's
  comedy of mistaken identity. Shipwrecked and separated from her twin brot
 her\, Viola disguises herself as a young man and enters Duke Orsino's serv
 ice\, only to fall for him while carrying his love letters to a countess w
 ho promptly falls for her. Meanwhile a forged letter and a pair of yellow 
 stockings send the pompous steward Malvolio into humiliating raptures. Fro
 m Pumphouse Players\, one of Georgia's oldest continuously operating commu
 nity theatre companies.
GEO:34.1644344;-84.7971239
LAST-MODIFIED:20260730T050020Z
LOCATION:Pumphouse Players\, 114 W Main St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/twelfth-night-tickets-1989767660636
END:VEVENT
