BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Philadelphia Story
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T220000
DTSTAMP:20260730T153943Z
UID:occ-593@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Philip Barry's 1939 high-society comedy: a socialite's second 
 wedding\, crashed by her ex-husband and two tabloid journalists.\n\nPhilip
  Barry's 1939 comedy of the privileged class. Tracy Lord\, headstrong daug
 hter of the Philadelphia Lords\, is set to marry a successful young snob w
 hen her ex-husband and a pair of tabloid journalists descend on the family
  estate for the wedding weekend. Barry wrote the role for Katharine Hepbur
 n\, who backed the play with her own money and carried it into the 1940 fi
 lm with Cary Grant and James Stewart. Darci Rose Wells directs for Lionhea
 rt Theatre\, where every ticket includes dessert at intermission\; runs th
 rough September 27.
GEO:33.9421741;-84.2112431
LAST-MODIFIED:20260730T050014Z
LOCATION:Lionheart Theatre\, 10 College St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://ci.ovationtix.com/35819/production/1276719/performance/1181317
 9
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Guys presented by THP Second Stage
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T213000
DTSTAMP:20260730T153943Z
UID:occ-2703@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Anne Nelson's two-hander: a fire captain and the editor who he
 lps him write eulogies after 9/11.\n\nAnne Nelson's drama drawn from a tru
 e story: in the weeks after September 11\, 2001\, a New York fire captain 
 has to eulogize the firefighters he lost and can't find the words\, so an 
 editor sits down to help him turn memories into tributes. Just two actors\
 , and more warmth and humor in it than the premise suggests. From the Henr
 y Players' Second Stage series\; runs 75 minutes with one intermission.
GEO:33.4486439;-84.1418279
LAST-MODIFIED:20260730T050010Z
LOCATION:The Henry Players Theater\, 136 Hood St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/the-guys-presented-by-thp-second-stage-tic
 kets-283661
END:VEVENT
