BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pride & Prejudice
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270122T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270122T213000
DTSTAMP:20260730T153943Z
UID:occ-1281@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Austen's comedy of courtship in a fast\, playful adaptation 
 — Lizzy Bennet swears off marriage\; Darcy keeps turning up.\n\nJane Aus
 ten's 1813 comedy of courtship\, here in a loose\, high-energy adaptation 
 that treats the marriage plot as a game with real stakes. Lizzy Bennet has
  decided she will never marry. Then Mr. Darcy — aggravating\, and only v
 aguely handsome by her account — keeps crossing her path. Presented by A
 rcadia Theater\, the Alpharetta community theatre.
GEO:34.0765277;-84.2884766
LAST-MODIFIED:20260730T045847Z
LOCATION:Arcadia Theater\, 180 Academy St
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/pride-prejudice-tickets-279864
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Much Ado About Nothing
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270122T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270122T221000
DTSTAMP:20260730T153943Z
UID:occ-1510@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Shakespeare's Beatrice and Benedick trade insults until their 
 friends trick them into love\, from the Atlanta Shakespeare Company.\n\nSh
 akespeare's comedy of two committed singles: Beatrice and Benedick spar so
  relentlessly that their friends conspire to make each believe the other i
 s secretly in love. Meanwhile the villainous Don John schemes to wreck the
  wedding of the young lovers Claudio and Hero. From the Atlanta Shakespear
 e Company\, performed Elizabethan-style with table seating and food and dr
 ink service during the show. A 2026 Suzi Bass Awards Recommended Show.
GEO:33.768171;-84.3851523
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T204412Z
LOCATION:Shakespeare Tavern Playhouse\, 499 Peachtree St NE
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.shakespearetavern.com/on-stage/company/much-ado-about-noth
 ing
END:VEVENT
